+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-src 'none'; worker-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container privacy-copy">
+    <h1>Privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>You can browse these informational pages without sharing your name, email address, or location.</p>
+    <h2>What these pages collect</h2>
+    <p>These pages contain no data collection forms, analytics, advertising, tracking pixels, or client-side scripts. They do not set cookies or use browser storage. There are no accounts, payments, or rewards services implemented in this static website.</p>
+    <h2>Images and third parties</h2>
+    <p>Our images and styles are served from this website. Viewing these pages does not load fonts, images, scripts, or embedded content from third-party services. The coffee photo was sourced from Unsplash and is hosted locally.</p>
+    <h2>Hosting and request data</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends technical information, including your IP address and the requested page, to the service hosting this website so it can deliver content. The hosting provider may keep access or security logs. Their retention and access settings are controlled by the site operator; these pages cannot delete those logs.</p>
+    <h2>Links and future services</h2>
+    <p>The navigation includes links to planned services. If account, ordering, or contact services are added, their data collection, purpose, retention, and privacy choices must be explained before you submit information. Do not put personal or payment information in page addresses.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co.</p></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
